{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10274060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10274060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1027406001:1":{"text":"Phew... good, just as I expected, altars that test wisdom don't usually consume their offerings.","source_cn":"呼……太好了，如我所料，这种考验智慧的机关祭坛通常不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9BAE6ED1A48F86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027406002:1":{"text":"That gem does seem to be worth quite a lot...\nI find your parting with it to be a bit suspicious if I'm being honest.","source_cn":"的确，这宝石看起来就非常值钱……\\n但你居然能把它拿出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05E253226351D314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027406003:1":{"text":"I took the risk, Bun-Bun, because I have enough expertise to understand the nature of this altar.","source_cn":"因为我足够渊博，知道祭坛的本质，才敢于冒险，兔耳朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D45D26AD14C7CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027406004:1":{"text":"I won't let you get under my skin this time, you greedy treasure fiend!","source_cn":"这次我可不会被你激怒，然后就被带偏话头了，贪婪的宝藏猎人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA2F3C01C0428079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027406005:1":{"text":"You obviously didn't realize you'd be able to get the gem back, and only relaxed once you did.","source_cn":"你明明是直到刚才确认收回了宝石，才终于松了口气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3E1F4958DC0B6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027406006:1":{"text":"Meaning you truly were willing to part ways with such an incredible stone.","source_cn":"在此之前，你都是明知宝石被作为祭品牺牲掉的可能性，却甘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7115C6279CD4F162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027406007:1":{"text":"So? Why does that matter?\nAs I said earlier, if there's treasure, we'll divide it according to everyone's equal efforts.","source_cn":"所以，这说明什么？\\n我前面也说过了，如果有宝藏，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1FE2C7AB76E9EF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027406008:1":{"text":"I don't know how we'll split it, but I do know one thing—","source_cn":"分不分成我不确定，但我至少可以猜出一件事——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E02C2607001DEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027406009:1":{"text":"Whatever treasure you're after is definitely worth more to you than that gem.","source_cn":"你想从宝藏中得到的东西，价值绝对高于这块美丽而昂贵的宝石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA193BA190A59DF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1027406009":{"text":"Whatever treasure you're after is definitely worth more to you than that gem.","source_cn":"你想从宝藏中得到的东西，价值绝对高于这块美丽而昂贵的宝石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA193BA190A59DF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027406010:1":{"text":"We become like the company we keep, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"毕竟近朱者赤嘛，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AC97CC062EC752F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We become like the company we keep, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"We become like the company we keep, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"108040","variant_female_record_index":"108041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027406011:1":{"text":"So, answer me, oh greedy little pilferer.\nWhat exactly do you want from the Deer Spirit's treasure?","source_cn":"所以，回答我吧，贪婪而不敬的宝藏猎人。\\n你到底想从鹿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFAD5A88BB603A98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027406012:1":{"text":"...Hahaha!","source_cn":"……哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00B5144EACEBF3C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027406013:1":{"text":"You've been yapping nonstop for half a day and still don't know what I want?","source_cn":"你滔滔不绝了半天，连我想要什么都不知道吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09234F415D9C281B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027406014:1":{"text":"You, the devout one, seem to know less than me, the \"greedy\", insolent one. Funny, huh?","source_cn":"虔诚的你，反而还不如我这个贪婪而不敬的人知道得多哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EF7CC01CEA8DC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1027406015:1":{"text":"You—you're such a... a...","source_cn":"你、你这个，你这个——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA65542DB2017BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1027406016:1":{"text":"Alright, we've wasted enough time bickering.","source_cn":"好啦，我们已经浪费不少时间了，口舌之争就到此为止吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B97E60E03F73DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027406017:1":{"text":"I'm not waiting any longer to get to the next puzzle—first come, first serve!","source_cn":"下个解谜我可不会再等了，先到者得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x505B36C4D5A0D09A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1027406018:0":{"text":"See ya!","source_cn":"先走一步，回见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1FD6665E5729CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1027406019:0":{"text":"Hey, wait! Stop right there!","source_cn":"喂！喂！你给我站住！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0FED00DE2E2B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Lorsan, you're getting smarter!","source_cn":"洛桑，你变聪明了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2217ED87EED89397","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Lorsan, you're getting smarter!","female":"Lorsan, you're getting smarter!","variant_male_record_index":"60828","variant_female_record_index":"60829","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"Atalanta","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":2}}